<!--
    YipDen's button in the in-app browser toolbar: "keep something from this page". A tray with an
    arrow dropping into it, the same idea as the iOS symbol (tray.and.arrow.down). One sign for
    every kind a reader can keep (a track, a comic page, a screenshot, a passage), so it never
    promises music on a page of comics. Not a bookmark, which Save for later already uses, and not
    an arch over a line with a plus in it, which was tried and reads as a gravestone.
-->
